{"seq":2,"slug":"pruning-training","title":"大学园艺学 — 整形修剪","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/pruning-training","wordCount":1735,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学园艺学-整形修剪\">大学园艺学 — 整形修剪</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>整形修剪是果树栽培中最具技术含量的管理环节，通过有目的地调控树体结构和枝条生长，实现光能高效利用、营养合理分配和持续丰产的目标。&quot;三分种，七分管&quot;——整形修剪正是这&quot;七分管&quot;中的核心内容。</p>\n<p>整形（Training）着眼于建立理想的树体骨架，修剪（Pruning）着眼于调节枝条生长与结果之间的平衡。两者密不可分，贯穿果树从幼树定植到衰老更新的全生命周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"修剪的生物学基础\">修剪的生物学基础</h3><p>修剪效应建立在果树生长的两个基本规律之上：</p>\n<p><strong>顶端优势</strong>：顶芽产生的生长素向下极性运输，抑制侧芽萌发。修剪去除顶端后，解除了对下部侧芽的抑制，促进分枝。顶端优势的强度因树种而异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>树种</th>\n<th>顶端优势</th>\n<th>自然树形</th>\n<th>修剪需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>苹果</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中心主干型</td>\n<td>需剪去竞争枝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桃</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>开心形</td>\n<td>需控制分枝量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梨</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中间型</td>\n<td>适度调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柑橘</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>圆头形</td>\n<td>轻剪为主</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>枝条极性</strong>：直立枝顶端生长旺盛，营养生长占优；水平或下垂枝生长势弱，有利于花芽分化。这一规律是&quot;拉枝开角&quot;技术的生理学依据：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>枝条角度</mtext><mo>↑</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>顶端优势</mtext><mo>↓</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>C/N 比</mtext><mo>↑</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>花芽形成</mtext><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{枝条角度} \\uparrow \\Rightarrow \\text{顶端优势} \\downarrow \\Rightarrow \\text{C/N 比} \\uparrow \\Rightarrow \\text{花芽形成} \\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">枝条角度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">顶端优势</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C/N </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">花芽形成</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>苹果主枝的理想角度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60°\\text{-}70°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">70°</span></span></span></span></span>（与主干的夹角），桃为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">45°\\text{-}55°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">55°</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主要树形\">主要树形</h3><p><strong>纺锤形</strong>（Spindle）：中心主干明显，主枝短小且均匀分布。适用于矮化密植苹果园，株行距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}2\\,\\text{m} \\times 3\\text{-}4\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>。树高控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5\\text{-}3.5\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>，主枝长度不超过行距的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span>。树冠呈上窄下宽的纺锤状，光照分布最均匀。</p>\n<p><strong>开心形</strong>（Open-center）：无中央领导干，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 个主枝从同一高度向外放射。适用于桃、李、杏等喜光果树。树体矮化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>），采收方便，冠内光照良好。</p>\n<p><strong>篱壁形</strong>（Hedge/Trellis）：树冠沿行向形成连续墙壁，果枝在支架引导下平面化分布。适用于苹果、梨的现代高密度果园（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 株/公顷）。光能截获率可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%\\text{-}80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>，远高于传统树形的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%\\text{-}60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>不同树形的光能利用效率比较：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>截获</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>入射</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{PAR_{\\text{截获}}}{PAR_{\\text{入射}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">入射</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">截获</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>树形</th>\n<th>种植密度（株/公顷）</th>\n<th>光截获率</th>\n<th>适用树种</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>乔化稀植</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300\\text{-}600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%\\text{-}55\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">55%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>传统苹果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纺锤形密植</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\text{-}2500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55\\%\\text{-}70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>矮化苹果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>篱壁形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2500</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2500\\text{-}5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65\\%\\text{-}80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>超矮化苹果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开心形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400\\text{-}800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%\\text{-}65\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">65%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>桃、杏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"修剪技术\">修剪技术</h3><p><strong>短截</strong>（Heading）：剪去枝条先端的一部分。根据剪去的长度分为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>轻短截（剪去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/4\\text{-}1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span>）：抑制顶端优势，促进剪口下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个芽萌发</li>\n<li>中短截（剪去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span>）：促发较多中庸分枝</li>\n<li>重短截（剪去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/3</span></span></span></span></span> 以上）：刺激少量强旺枝抽生</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>疏剪</strong>（Thinning）：将枝条从基部完全去除。不刺激剪口附近萌发，但改善冠内通风透光。每年疏除量应控制在总枝量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%\\text{-}25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>，过多会削弱树势。</p>\n<p><strong>回缩</strong>（Renewal pruning）：在多年生枝的中部回缩至带有分枝处。用于衰老树的更新复壮和过长结果枝组的回缩。</p>\n<p><strong>长放（缓放）</strong>：对一年生枝不做任何修剪处理。利用其枝条中下部花芽自然分化结果，是幼树早果丰产的关键技术。长放枝随着年龄增加弯曲下垂，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 年后再回缩处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"夏季修剪\">夏季修剪</h3><p>夏季修剪（生长期修剪）直接在生长季节调节树体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>摘心</strong>：新梢长到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{-}30\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时去除顶端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 叶，促进花芽分化</li>\n<li><strong>拉枝</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\text{-}8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 月用绳子或拉枝器将直立枝拉至目标角度</li>\n<li><strong>疏枝</strong>：疏除过密新梢改善光照</li>\n<li><strong>扭梢</strong>：将新梢中部扭转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span></span></span></span></span>，人为阻断养分运输</li>\n</ul>\n<p>夏剪对树体的影响比冬剪更为直接和迅速。光合面积的即时减少会降低当年光合产量，因此夏剪量应严格控制，总叶面积减少不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"疏花疏果\">疏花疏果</h3><p>疏花疏果是调节果实负载量、平衡大小年结果的关键措施。留果量以叶果比为指导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>叶果比</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>功能叶片数</mtext><mtext>果实数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{叶果比} = \\frac{\\text{功能叶片数}}{\\text{果实数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">叶果比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">果实数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">功能叶片数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>树种</th>\n<th>适宜叶果比</th>\n<th>单果重依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>苹果（富士）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\text{-}60:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>250</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;250\\,\\text{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梨（鸭梨）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\text{-}30:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;200\\,\\text{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桃（水蜜桃）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{-}30:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;200\\,\\text{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柑橘（脐橙）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\text{-}60:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;200\\,\\text{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>疏果时间越早效果越好——花后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 周（细胞分裂期）疏果，可使保留果实的细胞数量增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%\\text{-}30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>，显著增大果个。化学疏花（NAA、BA）可替代部分人工，但精度较低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某苹果园采用乔化砧木，定植 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 年后树体过于高大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;5\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>），冠内郁闭严重。设计一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 年的改造方案，将其逐步转变为开心形矮化树形。</li>\n<li>解释为什么拉枝角度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;90°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span></span></span></span></span>（下垂）反而不利于花芽分化和结果？从顶端优势完全丧失后的生长反应角度分析。</li>\n<li>某桃园果实偏小（平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150\\,\\text{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span>），全树约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span></span></span></span></span> 个果，总叶片数约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15000</span></span></span></span></span> 片。计算当前叶果比并提出疏果方案。</li>\n<li>比较篱壁形和纺锤形在机械化管理（机械修剪、机械采收）方面的优势差异。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解<strong>机械化修剪</strong>在大规模果园中的应用，特别是感知-决策-执行一体化的智能修剪机器人</li>\n<li>研究<strong>三维树形建模</strong>技术如何量化树冠结构与光分布的关系</li>\n<li>探索<strong>超高密度果园</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span> 株/公顷）的全球发展趋势和经济效益分析</li>\n<li>阅读日本果树修剪技术的精细化管理经验</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>整形修剪是果树栽培中理论与实践结合最紧密的技术环节。顶端优势和枝条极性是修剪效应的生物学基础，树形设计决定了光能利用效率的上限。冬季修剪调整骨架结构，夏季修剪精细调节生长势，疏花疏果平衡营养与生殖生长的关系。从传统的乔化稀植到现代的矮化密植和篱壁形果园，整形修剪体系的演变始终围绕着提高单位面积产量和劳动效率这一核心目标。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学园艺学 — 整形修剪","id":"大学园艺学-整形修剪"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"修剪的生物学基础","id":"修剪的生物学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"主要树形","id":"主要树形"},{"level":3,"text":"修剪技术","id":"修剪技术"},{"level":3,"text":"夏季修剪","id":"夏季修剪"},{"level":3,"text":"疏花疏果","id":"疏花疏果"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学园艺学 — 果树生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/fruit-tree-biology"},"next":{"title":"大学园艺学 — 采后技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/postharvest-technology"}}